flowchart TD
    Candidate[Candidate Taking Exam] --> Detection{Agent ELI / Browser Trap}

    Detection -->|Shortcut Ctrl+C/V/X/A| SC_Check{First Violation?}
    SC_Check -->|Yes| SC_Warn[Warning Modal 0 Demerits]
    SC_Check -->|No| SC_Demerit[Add +1 Demerit Point]
    SC_Warn --> Resume[Candidate Resumes Session]
    SC_Demerit --> DemeritPool

    Detection -->|Page Reload F5/Ctrl+R| ReloadAction[Direct Auto-Submit Beacon API]
    ReloadAction --> Terminate[Exam Auto-Submitted & Locked]

    Detection -->|Tab Switch or Window Blur| TabAction[Add +2 Demerits & Start 10s Timer]
    TabAction --> TabTimer{Away > 10 Seconds?}
    TabTimer -->|No| DemeritPool
    TabTimer -->|Yes| TabModal[5s Countdown Modal]
    TabModal -->|Dismissed or Timeout| Terminate
    TabModal -->|Returned in 5s| DemeritPool

    Detection -->|Mobile Phone Detected| PhoneTimer{Visible >= 5 Seconds?}
    PhoneTimer -->|No| Resume
    PhoneTimer -->|Yes| PhoneModal[5s Confirmation Modal]
    PhoneModal -->|Unconfirmed| Terminate
    PhoneModal -->|Confirmed Removed| Resume

    Detection -->|Book or Notebook| BookAction[Add +1 Demerit per 5 Seconds]
    BookAction --> DemeritPool

    Detection -->|Network Disconnected| NetAction[Exam On Hold 5-Min Countdown Modal]
    NetAction --> NetTimer{Offline > 5 Minutes?}
    NetTimer -->|No Returned| NetRestore[Dismiss Modal & Resume Exam]
    NetTimer -->|Yes Exceeded| Terminate
    NetRestore --> Resume

    DemeritPool[Demerit Points Accumulator] --> ThresholdCheck{Demerit Points >= 10?}
    ThresholdCheck -->|No| UpdateMeter[Update Live UI Demerit Bar]
    UpdateMeter --> Resume
    ThresholdCheck -->|Yes| Terminate